{
  "_说明": "工厂配置。随包发在 ProductTestTool.exe 同目录，产线可直接改；缺键用软件内置默认值。stationItems（各产品各工位的测试项勾选）由管理员在软件内配置后自动写入本文件。",
  "_updateSource说明": "在线升级源 = 工厂内网共享目录（UNC 用正斜杠写，JSON 里反斜杠要转义容易错）。下面是占位示例，等工厂发来真实路径后改这一行再发版。升级永不覆盖本文件。",
  "updateSource": "//192.168.1.10/ptest_update",
  "shutdownDelaySec": 120,
  "pollIntervalMs": 500,
  "heartbeatTimeoutSec": 15,
  "timeouts": {
    "normalMs": 10000,
    "flashMs": 15000,
    "peripheralMs": 15000,
    "cellularMs": 40000
  },
  "peripheral": {
    "sdTestSizeMb": 1,
    "whiteBrightness": 100,
    "ledBlinkMs": 500,
    "speakerRepeat": 1
  },
  "rtspUrlTemplate": "rtsp://%1:554/tenda",
  "discoverySendPort": 7320,
  "discoveryListenPort": 7319,
  "discoveryWord": "td_adjustlenstest",
  "discoveryIntervalMs": 800
